{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/Bench.gif?t=1764601608\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timber trail is a 3D Pixel horror game which takes place in a peaceful forrest. One day When you go for a hike, you decide to not go your usual route, but take a different route called the &quot;Timber trail&quot;.\u00a0 A trail feared by the locals because of it's tales of people mysteriously disapearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Timber Trail and uncover its secrets, talk to fellow hikers, escape the forest if your curiosity takes you too far...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Horror narrative, dipped in a pixel 3D Aestestic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interacting with items, people, talking options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796220?t=1764601608","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/f38ec10a0d2b6a031fe1d12ea1126ff825d8229a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764601608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/fe5734e479a49880d58f6bc9276ee5bca637d591/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764601608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/fe5734e479a49880d58f6bc9276ee5bca637d591/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764601608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only